<title>AUSTRIA: Buba's Welteke says sees EMU starting on time.</title>
<headline>Buba's Welteke says sees EMU starting on time.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank council member Ernst Welteke said on Wednesday he was confident that the planned single European currency would start on time.</p>
<p>&quot;I continue to believe that EMU will start on January 1, 1999,&quot; he told reporters during a conference organised by the Austrian National Bank. -- Vienna newsroom 43-1 531 12 254</p>
</text>
